(5741197, 835348, 110041, '<td valign="top">I love the smoke and the scene. It''s nice and crisp and the colours are pleasing.<br/> <br/>It''s just a shame that the girls are all looking at different things and it could do with being cropped on the right hand side.</td>', 'I love the smoke and the scene. It''s nice and crisp and the colours are pleasing. It''s just a shame that the girls are all looking at different things and it could do with being cropped on the right hand side.', '2009-11-25 08:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5741202, 835145, 110041, '<td valign="top">A nice snap shot.</td>', 'A nice snap shot.', '2009-11-25 08:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5741206, 835139, 110041, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t be surprised if this scored well. It has plenty of elements which fit it to the challenge and the concept is very good.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately, I just don''t like it I''m afraid. It might be that the pout is a little off putting and the lighting is not dynamic enough and spoils the mood. Just a little over produced.</td>', 'I wouldn''t be surprised if this scored well. It has plenty of elements which fit it to the challenge and the concept is very good. Unfortunately, I just don''t like it I''m afraid. It might be that the pout is a little off putting and the lighting is not dynamic enough and spoils the mood. Just a little over produced.', '2009-11-25 08:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5741210, 835261, 110041, '<td valign="top">It''s at an awkward angle and crop. It might have benefitted from taking a few steps back and getting more of the undergrowth /ground in.</td>', 'It''s at an awkward angle and crop. It might have benefitted from taking a few steps back and getting more of the undergrowth /ground in.', '2009-11-25 08:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5741222, 835213, 110041, '<td valign="top">I don''t get a sense of ''doubt'' from the photo. I see the cross on the arm which is the only tie with religion in the photo that I can make out.<br/> <br/>It is a nice photo in its own right.</td>', 'I don''t get a sense of ''doubt'' from the photo. I see the cross on the arm which is the only tie with religion in the photo that I can make out. It is a nice photo in its own right.', '2009-11-25 08:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5741268, 835299, 59276, '<td valign="top">Love Love Love the color and your framing. wonderful job, I''m sure you will be wearing a ribbon soon!</td>', 'Love Love Love the color and your framing. wonderful job, I''m sure you will be wearing a ribbon soon!', '2009-11-25 09:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
