(5741521, 835252, 3102, '<td valign="top">Amazing place, isn''t it?  That was on the top of my list when I visited Sedona last summer.  I would have preferred that the shot be straightened up a bit, but it certainly brings back good memories of my visit there.</td>', 'Amazing place, isn''t it?  That was on the top of my list when I visited Sedona last summer.  I would have preferred that the shot be straightened up a bit, but it certainly brings back good memories of my visit there.', '2009-11-25 12:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5741541, 835403, 108580, '<td valign="top">Looks like a German gravestone not that that has anything to do with the price of eggs! I like the composition and the B and W adds mood to the take, but the focus imho should be on the pidgeon''s head not his <strike>arse</strike> tail feathers :)</td>', 'Looks like a German gravestone not that that has anything to do with the price of eggs! I like the composition and the B and W adds mood to the take, but the focus imho should be on the pidgeon''s head not his arse tail feathers :)', '2009-11-25 12:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5741543, 835254, 33182, '<td valign="top">Love the look of the one on the right..."Am I gonna get in trouble for this, even though I was asked to do it?" While the one on the left is like...:ROCK ON!!!!"</td>', 'Love the look of the one on the right..."Am I gonna get in trouble for this, even though I was asked to do it?" While the one on the left is like...:ROCK ON!!!!"', '2009-11-25 12:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5741545, 835368, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great comp. Almost HDR''like. Great sky and sky reflection in the attic window. Subtle shade on the wall. Green''s in the grass covered by late afternoon/early morning shade. All in all a pleasing photo.</td>', 'Great comp. Almost HDR''like. Great sky and sky reflection in the attic window. Subtle shade on the wall. Green''s in the grass covered by late afternoon/early morning shade. All in all a pleasing photo.', '2009-11-25 12:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5741546, 835137, 28427, '<td valign="top">Impressive. Looking at this pictures gives the feeling that I''m falling backwards.</td>', 'Impressive. Looking at this pictures gives the feeling that I''m falling backwards.', '2009-11-25 12:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5741559, 835143, 108580, '<td valign="top">Shot''s good, well composed, has lots to look at, but perhaps needs a bit more contrast and sat in PP. I''m not judging (you or your congregation). The depiction shows how ostentatious (branches of) the church in many ways has become. The priest and preceedings are faaaar away from the congregation. The enormous mural of Christ is overbearing. I prefer closer accessible places of worship.</td>', 'Shot''s good, well composed, has lots to look at, but perhaps needs a bit more contrast and sat in PP. I''m not judging (you or your congregation). The depiction shows how ostentatious (branches of) the church in many ways has become. The priest and preceedings are faaaar away from the congregation. The enormous mural of Christ is overbearing. I prefer closer accessible places of worship.', '2009-11-25 13:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5741568, 835138, 108580, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and shade. Browns are well graduated. I''m not liking the plants bottom of window circle or in glass reflection.<br/>Looks like He is pressing His communicator to be "beamed up" :P<br/>I wonder why His depiction is always made to look so sad?</td>', 'Nice tones and shade. Browns are well graduated. I''m not liking the plants bottom of window circle or in glass reflection.Looks like He is pressing His communicator to be "beamed up" :PI wonder why His depiction is always made to look so sad?', '2009-11-25 13:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5741571, 835359, 28427, '<td valign="top">Creative, for sure.</td>', 'Creative, for sure.', '2009-11-25 13:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5741573, 835225, 28427, '<td valign="top">serene image</td>', 'serene image', '2009-11-25 13:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5741581, 834975, 108580, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t agree more. Makes me sick. You can''t buy your way in...<br/>I like the boldness of your statement, the OOB thinking. The comp is great as is the tree and its cast shadow. Lens appears/is a bit soft on the outer edges at this angle or your DOF could have been a bit more.</td>', 'Couldn''t agree more. Makes me sick. You can''t buy your way in...I like the boldness of your statement, the OOB thinking. The comp is great as is the tree and its cast shadow. Lens appears/is a bit soft on the outer edges at this angle or your DOF could have been a bit more.', '2009-11-25 13:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5741589, 835403, 28427, '<td valign="top">The B/W gives this an additional value.  Nice work</td>', 'The B/W gives this an additional value.  Nice work', '2009-11-25 13:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5741590, 834632, 108580, '<td valign="top">Masterful shot. Everything about this is appealing to me. Colours, ambient lighting, architecture, the subject. Just a pity about the man walking away in the distance. 8</td>', 'Masterful shot. Everything about this is appealing to me. Colours, ambient lighting, architecture, the subject. Just a pity about the man walking away in the distance. 8', '2009-11-25 13:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5741594, 835359, 108580, '<td valign="top">hehe OOB thinking right up my alley. Higher marks for not being conformist.<br/>The shot is not my style but it has impact and makes you LOOK and discover.</td>', 'hehe OOB thinking right up my alley. Higher marks for not being conformist.The shot is not my style but it has impact and makes you LOOK and discover.', '2009-11-25 13:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
