(5743075, 835495, 98771, '<td valign="top">Don''t have a clue how you done this, but it''s pretty nice.</td>', 'Don''t have a clue how you done this, but it''s pretty nice.', '2009-11-26 18:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743110, 835254, 14211, '<td valign="top">but they are SO cute!!!!</td>', 'but they are SO cute!!!!', '2009-11-26 19:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743249, 835491, 111808, '<td valign="top">This contains many different textures which blend together well. The white cross in the main brick facade partially echoes the horizontal evenness while at the same time breaks it up with the vertical half. The parallel lines of the small stained glass window are duplicated in the similar one on the right tower in a delightful synchronicity. The deep blue sky with cloud patterns is the final element that completes this well. Simple, balanced, beautiful.</td>', 'This contains many different textures which blend together well. The white cross in the main brick facade partially echoes the horizontal evenness while at the same time breaks it up with the vertical half. The parallel lines of the small stained glass window are duplicated in the similar one on the right tower in a delightful synchronicity. The deep blue sky with cloud patterns is the final element that completes this well. Simple, balanced, beautiful.', '2009-11-26 21:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743264, 834679, 111808, '<td valign="top">The brown Eye breaks up the grey white shingle pattern and immediately draws one''s own eye into the view to the centre. Studying this is a delight from the striped patterns on the aged wood to some of the raised nails and the sprinkling of the autumn leaves blown there by the unaware wind. The stain from the eye - could this be construed as weeping for what was - or perhaps is yet to come?</td>', 'The brown Eye breaks up the grey white shingle pattern and immediately draws one''s own eye into the view to the centre. Studying this is a delight from the striped patterns on the aged wood to some of the raised nails and the sprinkling of the autumn leaves blown there by the unaware wind. The stain from the eye - could this be construed as weeping for what was - or perhaps is yet to come?', '2009-11-26 21:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743273, 835254, 111808, '<td valign="top">Thank you SO MUCH for the hearty Laugh I got when I keyed into this. An interesting take on the subject of Religion and perhaps one that some people would agree with considering the history of the various churches of the world seen in the context of Time.</td>', 'Thank you SO MUCH for the hearty Laugh I got when I keyed into this. An interesting take on the subject of Religion and perhaps one that some people would agree with considering the history of the various churches of the world seen in the context of Time.', '2009-11-26 21:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743280, 835403, 111808, '<td valign="top">A poignant reminder of Loss and Love never forgotten. The feather patterns and the cock of the head of the quietly waiting Dove are excellent and emotive. The tones of this simple photograph capture the dichotomy of dark and light which Religion encapsulates in query. Answers which bring more questions into play. I love this.</td>', 'A poignant reminder of Loss and Love never forgotten. The feather patterns and the cock of the head of the quietly waiting Dove are excellent and emotive. The tones of this simple photograph capture the dichotomy of dark and light which Religion encapsulates in query. Answers which bring more questions into play. I love this.', '2009-11-26 22:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743290, 835487, 111808, '<td valign="top">A white church, the quintessential symbol of organised Religion with the shadow of the older Tree of Life, indicative of quite another and older Celtic Natural religion, towering over it is a telling juxtaposition and a statement with much more between the lines than would first appear in a casual look at this. A favourite in this challenge to me - The chimney and the structure bear many straight lines, the Tree is curved and bends with the changing winds.</td>', 'A white church, the quintessential symbol of organised Religion with the shadow of the older Tree of Life, indicative of quite another and older Celtic Natural religion, towering over it is a telling juxtaposition and a statement with much more between the lines than would first appear in a casual look at this. A favourite in this challenge to me - The chimney and the structure bear many straight lines, the Tree is curved and bends with the changing winds.', '2009-11-26 22:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743296, 835136, 111808, '<td valign="top">This Cross is old and worn, broken, grey - yet it is still powerfully imposing in this excellent photograph. The stones surrounding it are smaller, sharper, perhaps more broken and littered with detritus of dead leaves, sparse grass, twigs, trials. The tones match well in this but are differentiated by the thickness and strength of the centre circle - no beginning, no end, eternity. Iota, Eta, Sigma - In Hoc Sanctis, in this place, sacred. Beautifully done.</td>', 'This Cross is old and worn, broken, grey - yet it is still powerfully imposing in this excellent photograph. The stones surrounding it are smaller, sharper, perhaps more broken and littered with detritus of dead leaves, sparse grass, twigs, trials. The tones match well in this but are differentiated by the thickness and strength of the centre circle - no beginning, no end, eternity. Iota, Eta, Sigma - In Hoc Sanctis, in this place, sacred. Beautifully done.', '2009-11-26 22:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743308, 835298, 111808, '<td valign="top">Multiple colours in complex repeating balanced patterns catch the eye immediately. This lavish building is slightly off balance however, retreating backwards - and what can be said of the significance of this? The sky goes from pale blue to white, lots of tones and shades surround this religious place, perhaps an allegory on a larger scale.</td>', 'Multiple colours in complex repeating balanced patterns catch the eye immediately. This lavish building is slightly off balance however, retreating backwards - and what can be said of the significance of this? The sky goes from pale blue to white, lots of tones and shades surround this religious place, perhaps an allegory on a larger scale.', '2009-11-26 22:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743311, 834666, 111808, '<td valign="top">Small candles of rememberance, starred, sparkling, reflecting, repeating in the form of a simple cross. Effective, refractive, beautiful. The black background makes this shine out.</td>', 'Small candles of rememberance, starred, sparkling, reflecting, repeating in the form of a simple cross. Effective, refractive, beautiful. The black background makes this shine out.', '2009-11-26 22:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743316, 835137, 111808, '<td valign="top">Great tones in this and great sharp clarity of the magnificent architecture of the cathedral. Stark black and white sky and the encroaching branches hint at a bit of a darker interpretation however, as does your title "Judgment Day" - and the person sitting on the stairs is waiting, dwarfed by the immensity and richness of the imposing edifice. Should the organisation of religion overpower the small Soul?</td>', 'Great tones in this and great sharp clarity of the magnificent architecture of the cathedral. Stark black and white sky and the encroaching branches hint at a bit of a darker interpretation however, as does your title "Judgment Day" - and the person sitting on the stairs is waiting, dwarfed by the immensity and richness of the imposing edifice. Should the organisation of religion overpower the small Soul?', '2009-11-26 22:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743370, 835490, 50695, '<td valign="top">I think eschatology is a bunch of hooey, but you do a very creative job of "illustrating" the concept.</td>', 'I think eschatology is a bunch of hooey, but you do a very creative job of "illustrating" the concept.', '2009-11-27 00:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
