(5743555, 835028, 98339, '<td valign="top">I am trying to get the connection of the title/picture with religion and I guess I am missing your message...(I can be quite dense at times)...that given...I really like the water reflection (don''t like the devastation this would have done) but it is a really cool capture</td>', 'I am trying to get the connection of the title/picture with religion and I guess I am missing your message...(I can be quite dense at times)...that given...I really like the water reflection (don''t like the devastation this would have done) but it is a really cool capture', '2009-11-27 09:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743557, 835499, 98339, '<td valign="top">Did you try to handhold the camera for this?  I see quite a bit of ghosting in the lower part of the image...I think a tripod would have improved this, your exposure is off just a bit...to much light for the window IMO and to much soft focus on the rest (caused by movement) you have an excellent composition although</td>', 'Did you try to handhold the camera for this?  I see quite a bit of ghosting in the lower part of the image...I think a tripod would have improved this, your exposure is off just a bit...to much light for the window IMO and to much soft focus on the rest (caused by movement) you have an excellent composition although', '2009-11-27 09:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743559, 835136, 98339, '<td valign="top">ok, this will be a totally picky comment from my point of view...IMO this could have been improved by two things 1) orientation of the picture...when looking at a cross "I" want to look from the bottom up...not from the side.  2) your exposure could have been a bit darker to give a very deep tonal feel to the picture</td>', 'ok, this will be a totally picky comment from my point of view...IMO this could have been improved by two things 1) orientation of the picture...when looking at a cross "I" want to look from the bottom up...not from the side.  2) your exposure could have been a bit darker to give a very deep tonal feel to the picture', '2009-11-27 09:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743560, 835220, 98339, '<td valign="top">excellent lighting and set-up...I know this takes sometime to do...well done</td>', 'excellent lighting and set-up...I know this takes sometime to do...well done', '2009-11-27 09:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743561, 835298, 98339, '<td valign="top">IMO this is overexposed in the top and sky areas...but what a bright building</td>', 'IMO this is overexposed in the top and sky areas...but what a bright building', '2009-11-27 09:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
