(5746208, 834889, 2333, '<td valign="top">A really well-done abstract. Here''s hoping it does well.</td>', 'A really well-done abstract. Here''s hoping it does well.', '2009-11-29 22:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746244, 835360, 94241, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color combination, the orange moon and purple sky.<br/> <br/>I wish the moon was in focus though.<br/> <br/>Also, I''m kinda bugged by the halo effect.  Against a cross, I guess I can see it acting as an artistic element.  But honestly, I think the halo kind of takes over and makes this image all about the special effects instead of about the subject.<br/> <br/>Great concept and great colors though.</td>', 'Beautiful color combination, the orange moon and purple sky. I wish the moon was in focus though. Also, I''m kinda bugged by the halo effect.  Against a cross, I guess I can see it acting as an artistic element.  But honestly, I think the halo kind of takes over and makes this image all about the special effects instead of about the subject. Great concept and great colors though.', '2009-11-29 23:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746248, 835436, 94241, '<td valign="top">Beautiful execution.  It bugs me just a smidgen that the cross is "upside down" to the viewer.</td>', 'Beautiful execution.  It bugs me just a smidgen that the cross is "upside down" to the viewer.', '2009-11-29 23:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746257, 835310, 94241, '<td valign="top">Great pose, great lighting.  I''m really digging how the light spills over his face, and I''m really digging how the book is so bright, bringing emphasis to it.<br/> <br/>One thing bugs me though:  By virtue of being in sharpest focus, and by virtue of being the biggest, brightest thing in the frame, this man''s shirt kind of tugs all my attention to it.  It''s an interesting shirt, but I''m not sure it''s what the shot is about.</td>', 'Great pose, great lighting.  I''m really digging how the light spills over his face, and I''m really digging how the book is so bright, bringing emphasis to it. One thing bugs me though:  By virtue of being in sharpest focus, and by virtue of being the biggest, brightest thing in the frame, this man''s shirt kind of tugs all my attention to it.  It''s an interesting shirt, but I''m not sure it''s what the shot is about.', '2009-11-29 23:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746258, 835471, 94241, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful.  I really love the leaves on the ground leading into the trees.  I just kind of wish the depth of field was a little wider.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful.  I really love the leaves on the ground leading into the trees.  I just kind of wish the depth of field was a little wider.', '2009-11-29 23:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746260, 835496, 94241, '<td valign="top">Huh, very psychedelic, but you know?  I really like it.</td>', 'Huh, very psychedelic, but you know?  I really like it.', '2009-11-29 23:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746263, 834889, 94241, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  It''s very painterly.</td>', 'Very cool.  It''s very painterly.', '2009-11-29 23:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746267, 835297, 94241, '<td valign="top">An issue very near and dear to my heart.<br/> <br/>Photographically, very cool.  Something''s a little funky with the way the vignette is playing with the highlights on the key fob.  I could be way off base here, apologies if so, but it doesn''t quite look natural.</td>', 'An issue very near and dear to my heart. Photographically, very cool.  Something''s a little funky with the way the vignette is playing with the highlights on the key fob.  I could be way off base here, apologies if so, but it doesn''t quite look natural.', '2009-11-30 00:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746272, 835453, 94241, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones.  I really like how the rosary(?) has the darkest black in the image.</td>', 'Beautiful tones.  I really like how the rosary(?) has the darkest black in the image.', '2009-11-30 00:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746277, 835316, 94241, '<td valign="top">Wow, the color of the gutters, framing the window, is awesome.</td>', 'Wow, the color of the gutters, framing the window, is awesome.', '2009-11-30 00:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746279, 835494, 94241, '<td valign="top">As awesome as your use of color and shape is, I tend to rate things low if I can''t figure out what the picture actually shows.</td>', 'As awesome as your use of color and shape is, I tend to rate things low if I can''t figure out what the picture actually shows.', '2009-11-30 00:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746291, 834845, 94241, '<td valign="top">I love the shot, and found myself staring at it.  But as I stared I started to notice a couple things that detracted.  First, it looks like a big screw instead of a nail.  :)   Second, the lighting on the boy''s face is a bit odd, which makes it kind of a washed out block of white.<br/> <br/>Besides that though, lighting and shadowing are beautiful, and the idea is top notch.  I love especially the dark of the hammer versus the light of the skin.</td>', 'I love the shot, and found myself staring at it.  But as I stared I started to notice a couple things that detracted.  First, it looks like a big screw instead of a nail.  :)   Second, the lighting on the boy''s face is a bit odd, which makes it kind of a washed out block of white. Besides that though, lighting and shadowing are beautiful, and the idea is top notch.  I love especially the dark of the hammer versus the light of the skin.', '2009-11-30 00:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746319, 835315, 94241, '<td valign="top">The shift of tones in this, and subtle use of color, are both absolutely awesome.<br/> <br/>I tried to type up what bugged me about this, and finally decided not one thing.  You made an image that disturbed me, got me to stare at it for a long time, and finally wish I could do something so cool.<br/> <br/>I think that means you win top score from me.  :)</td>', 'The shift of tones in this, and subtle use of color, are both absolutely awesome. I tried to type up what bugged me about this, and finally decided not one thing.  You made an image that disturbed me, got me to stare at it for a long time, and finally wish I could do something so cool. I think that means you win top score from me.  :)', '2009-11-30 00:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746329, 835028, 94241, '<td valign="top">Clever concept, but subtle.  I honestly didn''t get it at first.</td>', 'Clever concept, but subtle.  I honestly didn''t get it at first.', '2009-11-30 00:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746337, 835507, 94241, '<td valign="top">The most in-focus point is the air vents, which I think kind of makes this picture as much about the car as the figure.  Including text of the radio display (words ALWAYS grab attention), I think also pulls attention from the figure.  I feel if you cropped it a bit different, this photo would have a stronger message.</td>', 'The most in-focus point is the air vents, which I think kind of makes this picture as much about the car as the figure.  Including text of the radio display (words ALWAYS grab attention), I think also pulls attention from the figure.  I feel if you cropped it a bit different, this photo would have a stronger message.', '2009-11-30 00:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746340, 834679, 94241, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful photo, great use of color and depth of field, but I''m not sure I understand how it''s religion.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful photo, great use of color and depth of field, but I''m not sure I understand how it''s religion.', '2009-11-30 00:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746347, 835353, 94241, '<td valign="top">The high-key background kind of overwhelms the lighting on the subject.</td>', 'The high-key background kind of overwhelms the lighting on the subject.', '2009-11-30 00:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746354, 835252, 94241, '<td valign="top">I''m a huge fan of broody, saturated images, but I almost think this one is pushed a little too far.  It''s amazing color.  But I stare at the rock and it looks almost clipped and blocky from over saturation.<br/> <br/>Very cool use of a wide angle perspective though.</td>', 'I''m a huge fan of broody, saturated images, but I almost think this one is pushed a little too far.  It''s amazing color.  But I stare at the rock and it looks almost clipped and blocky from over saturation. Very cool use of a wide angle perspective though.', '2009-11-30 00:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746356, 835138, 94241, '<td valign="top">Hmm, the shadowed reflection makes me think of Darth Vader.</td>', 'Hmm, the shadowed reflection makes me think of Darth Vader.', '2009-11-30 00:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746359, 835474, 94241, '<td valign="top">Great tonal contrast.<br/> <br/>So much noise though!</td>', 'Great tonal contrast. So much noise though!', '2009-11-30 00:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746362, 834874, 94241, '<td valign="top">Beautiful setup, but I wish the cross was in focus.</td>', 'Beautiful setup, but I wish the cross was in focus.', '2009-11-30 00:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746366, 835203, 94241, '<td valign="top">Moose Peterson, wildlife photog, emphasizes at every soapbox he''s given:  The brightest thing in a picture grabs the attention of the viewer.<br/> <br/>Accordingly, this image has a heavenly light from above wiping the sky to white?  :)<br/> <br/>Maybe shoot this image in late evening just before or just after sunset.</td>', 'Moose Peterson, wildlife photog, emphasizes at every soapbox he''s given:  The brightest thing in a picture grabs the attention of the viewer. Accordingly, this image has a heavenly light from above wiping the sky to white?  :) Maybe shoot this image in late evening just before or just after sunset.', '2009-11-30 00:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746369, 835261, 94241, '<td valign="top">Beautiful old building.  The "S CLUB H" sign in the bottom right breaks the image though.  :(</td>', 'Beautiful old building.  The "S CLUB H" sign in the bottom right breaks the image though.  :(', '2009-11-30 00:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746553, 835359, 84668, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your brown... Not voting.</td>', 'Congrats on your brown... Not voting.', '2009-11-30 07:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746690, 835394, 10785, '<td valign="top">It''s a great shot, well exposed, nice black background and lovely red color on the rose. It looks like it is suffering from jpg conversion and resize. Unfortunately there is some definite jagged pixelating on the edges of the pages and the text lost some detail. I''ll bet the original does not show this.</td>', 'It''s a great shot, well exposed, nice black background and lovely red color on the rose. It looks like it is suffering from jpg conversion and resize. Unfortunately there is some definite jagged pixelating on the edges of the pages and the text lost some detail. I''ll bet the original does not show this.', '2009-11-30 11:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5747080, 835495, 48926, '<td valign="top">That''s cool!</td>', 'That''s cool!', '2009-11-30 16:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5747094, 834845, 4573, '<td valign="top">If it wasn''t obvious that it was a rubber hammer and a hex head bolt I think the picture would have pulled a higher rating.  The thought was good.</td>', 'If it wasn''t obvious that it was a rubber hammer and a hex head bolt I think the picture would have pulled a higher rating.  The thought was good.', '2009-11-30 16:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5747096, 835400, 4573, '<td valign="top">Good lighting.</td>', 'Good lighting.', '2009-11-30 16:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5747101, 835494, 4573, '<td valign="top">Looks like he is smoking a cigarette.</td>', 'Looks like he is smoking a cigarette.', '2009-11-30 16:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5747103, 834614, 4573, '<td valign="top">Strong content.</td>', 'Strong content.', '2009-11-30 16:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5747108, 835507, 4573, '<td valign="top">If you are going to drive 100 MPH you may want to turn him around to face the road.</td>', 'If you are going to drive 100 MPH you may want to turn him around to face the road.', '2009-11-30 16:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5747116, 835384, 4573, '<td valign="top">A unique way to witness.</td>', 'A unique way to witness.', '2009-11-30 16:56:29.000000', NULL, 1);
