(5747439, 835139, 33361, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better if he/she (I can''t tell) didn''t have make-up on.</td>', 'I think this would have been better if he/she (I can''t tell) didn''t have make-up on.', '2009-11-30 21:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
