(5747442, 835259, 33361, '<td valign="top">to effectively capture an image like this I think it needs to be centered.. the top is but the bottom is off.</td>', 'to effectively capture an image like this I think it needs to be centered.. the top is but the bottom is off.', '2009-11-30 21:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
