(5749870, 834632, 54778, '<td valign="top">Here are the two outtakes of the millions I could have chosen.. I get the feeling they might have done better.. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/urfa/4152986512/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//farm3.static.flickr.com/2804/4152986512_262ba3519d_m.jpg'', strrpos(''//farm3.static.flickr.com/2804/4152986512_262ba3519d_m.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//farm3.static.flickr.com/2804/4152986512_262ba3519d_m.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/urfa/4152986510/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//farm3.static.flickr.com/2598/4152986510_0a1db4a47c_m.jpg'', strrpos(''//farm3.static.flickr.com/2598/4152986510_0a1db4a47c_m.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//farm3.static.flickr.com/2598/4152986510_0a1db4a47c_m.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Thank you so much for the comments and votes.. I must admit this could be better compositional wise but I was busy trying not to get people in the background.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-12-02 07:41:55.</i></td>', 'Here are the two outtakes of the millions I could have chosen.. I get the feeling they might have done better..      Thank you so much for the comments and votes.. I must admit this could be better compositional wise but I was busy trying not to get people in the background.', '2009-12-02 07:30:09.000000', '2009-12-02 07:41:55.000000', 0),
