(5749921, 834330, 67697, '<td valign="top">FWIW, on my monitor, this is pretty dark.  So it is hard to make out what the people are doing or even wearing.  I wan''t really voting based on denomination.  I was voting based on whether the photo intrigued me.  I gave it a 5, mostly because you cannot see what the people are doing here and the photo doesn''t seem to engage the viewer.  It''s too bad that you think people voted on stereotypes.  Maybe some people gave 1''s because they just don''t like religion - period.</td>', 'FWIW, on my monitor, this is pretty dark.  So it is hard to make out what the people are doing or even wearing.  I wan''t really voting based on denomination.  I was voting based on whether the photo intrigued me.  I gave it a 5, mostly because you cannot see what the people are doing here and the photo doesn''t seem to engage the viewer.  It''s too bad that you think people voted on stereotypes.  Maybe some people gave 1''s because they just don''t like religion - period.', '2009-12-02 08:38:45.000000', NULL, 0),
