(5750146, 835290, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh man! This is fabulous.  I tried to take pictures inside a cathedral when I was in New York, and I got so much lens flare.  Was that because I used a flash?  We were just walking around for the day and didn''t have tripods with us so we had to use a flash, but it did not work.  It makes me appreciate perfection like this even more!<br/> <br/>CONGRATULATIONS!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh man! This is fabulous.  I tried to take pictures inside a cathedral when I was in New York, and I got so much lens flare.  Was that because I used a flash?  We were just walking around for the day and didn''t have tripods with us so we had to use a flash, but it did not work.  It makes me appreciate perfection like this even more! CONGRATULATIONS! ', '2009-12-02 11:07:17.000000', NULL, 0),
