(5750535, 835447, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good idea for a photo and the square crop works for me.  I would say a little more contrast and brighten up the building a bit as it comes across more as underexposed than with the message you are trying to portray.<br/> <br/>I didn''t vote in this challenge but probably would have given it a 4 or 5.</td>', 'Good idea for a photo and the square crop works for me.  I would say a little more contrast and brighten up the building a bit as it comes across more as underexposed than with the message you are trying to portray. I didn''t vote in this challenge but probably would have given it a 4 or 5.', '2009-12-02 13:16:19.000000', NULL, 0),
