(5753713, 835137, 112579, '<td valign="top">There is something rather fake looking about this image, and I believe it is the dark sky in relation to the very crisp and sharply lit church.<br/>This tells me that the shooter relies a lot on the computer to create his photo rather than shoot it better at the start.<br/>I see this as being a photo-illustration rather than a photograph of a church.<br/>No ribbons from me on this one.</td>', 'There is something rather fake looking about this image, and I believe it is the dark sky in relation to the very crisp and sharply lit church.This tells me that the shooter relies a lot on the computer to create his photo rather than shoot it better at the start.I see this as being a photo-illustration rather than a photograph of a church.No ribbons from me on this one.', '2009-12-04 06:56:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5754197, 834614, 90947, '<td valign="top">This is an exceptionally powerful image; particularly in this time in history.  I wish you had documented your thoughts on the shot, for example:<br/> <br/>Trying to send a message?<br/>Lucky snapshot (I think not based on the great lighting and reveled documented by the reflections in the eyes.)?<br/>How many models you had to review before finding such intense and beautiful eyes.<br/> <br/>Truly, this is one of my favorites.<br/> <br/>Congratulations.<br/></td>', 'This is an exceptionally powerful image; particularly in this time in history.  I wish you had documented your thoughts on the shot, for example: Trying to send a message?Lucky snapshot (I think not based on the great lighting and reveled documented by the reflections in the eyes.)?How many models you had to review before finding such intense and beautiful eyes. Truly, this is one of my favorites. Congratulations.', '2009-12-04 11:51:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5754217, 835004, 90947, '<td valign="top">You were robbed.  <br/> <br/>I am awestruck.  I really wonder what it on her mind, and where your model found the emotion to bring to your shot.<br/> <br/>I guess the nature of the shot limited your scores.  I can''t imagine anyone giving 1s or 2s or 3s.  What in the world were they thinking?  This is a nine or ten shot at a minimum.</td>', 'You were robbed.   I am awestruck.  I really wonder what it on her mind, and where your model found the emotion to bring to your shot. I guess the nature of the shot limited your scores.  I can''t imagine anyone giving 1s or 2s or 3s.  What in the world were they thinking?  This is a nine or ten shot at a minimum.', '2009-12-04 12:00:48.000000', NULL, 0),
