(5760443, 834606, 23484, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. I like the colors and nicely composed.</td>', 'Beautiful image. I like the colors and nicely composed.', '2009-12-08 21:15:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5760609, 835400, 108580, '<td valign="top">Wow, the light in this is just majestic, "shining from above."  Great composure too. The lack of DOF in the front is worrying. Did you focus only on the cross at the top of the arch? If you shot it in Aperture priority give it at least 2 more stops, maybe 3 and get out that tripod if you didn''t already. I use the timer or a small after market qireless remote control to fire the camera to prevent camera shake when pressing that shutter button.<br/>Your eye for detail in this shot was really superb, keep ''em coming Dan.</td>', 'Wow, the light in this is just majestic, "shining from above."  Great composure too. The lack of DOF in the front is worrying. Did you focus only on the cross at the top of the arch? If you shot it in Aperture priority give it at least 2 more stops, maybe 3 and get out that tripod if you didn''t already. I use the timer or a small after market qireless remote control to fire the camera to prevent camera shake when pressing that shutter button.Your eye for detail in this shot was really superb, keep ''em coming Dan.', '2009-12-08 23:57:21.000000', NULL, 0),
