(5760764, 835028, 108580, '<td valign="top">I got it, so did PennyStreet and Wyvern and omg NikonJeb did too. More proof that Joe Bloggs should never be hired to judge professional photo competitions...theres a reason why there''s a panel of (respected) judges chosen for that. Those 18 x 1''s, 15 x 2''s, 29 x 3''s and 45 x 4''s should be ashamed of themselves for not affording you more than 1/1000th of a second of their time...</td>', 'I got it, so did PennyStreet and Wyvern and omg NikonJeb did too. More proof that Joe Bloggs should never be hired to judge professional photo competitions...theres a reason why there''s a panel of (respected) judges chosen for that. Those 18 x 1''s, 15 x 2''s, 29 x 3''s and 45 x 4''s should be ashamed of themselves for not affording you more than 1/1000th of a second of their time...', '2009-12-09 00:50:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5760769, 835494, 108580, '<td valign="top">Nice brown going there ''bro hehe. Can you award yourself a ribbon? I refrained from commenting on the phallic thing, thought maybe it was intentional but the batteries were flat...watch how many people will now suddenly award this a posthumous in the forums but by looking at the Voting Breakdown only six gave it above 7...</td>', 'Nice brown going there ''bro hehe. Can you award yourself a ribbon? I refrained from commenting on the phallic thing, thought maybe it was intentional but the batteries were flat...watch how many people will now suddenly award this a posthumous in the forums but by looking at the Voting Breakdown only six gave it above 7...', '2009-12-09 00:54:18.000000', NULL, 0),
