(5896151, 835491, 28710, '<td valign="top">In the thumbs, this looks very striking. It seems a bit oversaturated in the blues though. This has also brought out a bit of unusual magenta stuff happening there as well. <br/> <br/>Even in basic, a hue/sat layer and a selective color layer would have taken care of that I think.</td>', 'In the thumbs, this looks very striking. It seems a bit oversaturated in the blues though. This has also brought out a bit of unusual magenta stuff happening there as well.  Even in basic, a hue/sat layer and a selective color layer would have taken care of that I think.', '2010-03-09 09:11:23.000000', NULL, 0),
