(5996615, 835501, 98339, '<td valign="top">so when were you in NO?  what a wonderful place!!!</td>', 'so when were you in NO?  what a wonderful place!!!', '2010-05-08 00:41:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6539720, 834330, 96751, '<td valign="top">My first impression of this image was that it was an interesting architectural image.  Especially because the pov is slightly tilted upward to take advantage of the beautiful chandelier and unique, ribbed ceiling, and because the pp''ing highlighted the upper half of the image while minimizing the lower portion where the people are. The lower portion is quite dark, and the people do not appear to be in any sort of worshipful stance. Without the title, it does not represent any sort of religion at all to me.</td>', 'My first impression of this image was that it was an interesting architectural image.  Especially because the pov is slightly tilted upward to take advantage of the beautiful chandelier and unique, ribbed ceiling, and because the pp''ing highlighted the upper half of the image while minimizing the lower portion where the people are. The lower portion is quite dark, and the people do not appear to be in any sort of worshipful stance. Without the title, it does not represent any sort of religion at all to me.', '2011-09-14 12:42:19.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
